Gordon W. Hunter, assistant deputy minister, Department of Defence Production, Ottawa;
W. L. Hutchison, vice-president, Moffats Limited. Weston, Ont.;
J. R. Jenkins, senior merchandise director, T. Eaton Co. Ltd., Toronto;
